# Human-driven Field Notes smoke over the explicit invitation route.
# A note written before the full roster exists must converge after nodes join;
# a sleeping node must catch up after it wakes.
add atlas
note written-before-cove
add beacon
add cove
wait-seen m1 atlas,beacon,cove 30
sleep atlas
use cove
note reply-from-edge
wait-seen m2 beacon,cove 30
wake atlas
wait-seen m2 atlas,beacon,cove 30
quit
